# Firebase / Google Cloud secrets (never commit service accounts or private keys)
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/google-services-key.json
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/GoogleService-Info.plist.bak
.env
.env.*

# Local-only bootstrap credentials from Member 1 cloud hardening
scripts/.seed_credentials.local.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/
